{
  "bodyHash": "Dq7CUXk2vdc=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.modrinth.com%252fdata%252fcached_images%252fe4ea284f084f6f28d0889479fac05a342ccde3c8.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e4ea284f084f6f28d0889479fac05a342ccde3c8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1150\" height=\"151\"></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「七大罪」模組新增超過10個新頭目。從代表七宗罪的七個頭目，到三個神話頭目，以及最終頭目路西法！挑戰這些強大的頭目，並製作他們的武器來強化你在Minecraft世界中的實力。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\">由 Ast0 開發。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Apw18fD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"328\" height=\"110\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#9c0\">此模組與 Better Combat 相容！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">所有頭目及其對應生態域列表如下：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">林奈，懶惰之罪：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff067aa39cf8657e3137c13e5755e5be2d59ddbb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"780\" height=\"868\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在遺忘森林生態域天空中的浮空島上找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">巴克斯，暴食之罪：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/767889636c8c50cabb0d579ac880adbe8da1409c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"791\" height=\"732\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在平原生態域的白色大廳中找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">芙蕾雅，色慾之罪：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/88de75553b249314fc55a7c5fb88ca75f0c6babf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"641\" height=\"759\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在針葉林生態域的城堡中找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">埃比尼澤，貪婪之罪：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/838865f2a9c490e75a45e7c644bdbd2ef8f9d3e9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"457\" height=\"586\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在沙漠中的浮空銅尖塔上找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">奧德蘭，嫉妒之罪：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/31d44f693e4026c955c626e882b895abd0367c05.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"629\" height=\"884\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/adc735345961d784ba10e59df47ba85d74223537.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"931\" height=\"938\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在橡木森林的巨大樹樁中找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">貝奧武夫，憤怒之罪：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0bf9231c83342b282ac22c74cf7b480a17afcec3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1049\" height=\"1036\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/85aac8c8681bedfd39af5c8d6ff2028d3c75a2c0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"1033\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在憤怒荒地的浮空結構中找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">里昂，傲慢之罪：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/56cd1d28734ba477a6862786f330465bf9ee8aa6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"698\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/844305ebb767b70631093cfca0629ddf4ff9247f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"757\" height=\"825\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在雪原/針葉林/海灘生態域的競技場中找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">路西法，暴行之罪：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d98011a4a8c589c62053e57181fe57934270098d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"724\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9067628b0ba9a6a830cad2a6f61f864bad7cc52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"876\" height=\"834\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在遺忘森林的浮空眼球中找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">石巨人：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/164cb09a4d7bfeb669161f0b1f69f54a084ed7e5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"637\" height=\"1048\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在平原生態域的小屋旁找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">德拉卡拉，永恆哀悼者：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c2cdefed8e0775200e2ae1eeaa8f67ebc53d3809.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"677\" height=\"980\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在地下墓穴中找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">詛咒騎士：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a1c15e04003a609bf3220ce89312a2139ae53ef4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"634\" height=\"727\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在遺忘森林的營地中找到。</span></p>\n</div>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">盔甲：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">罪鑄盔甲</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/65707ce9c8a7fb383fdf4cb47187fd3e24eb3547.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"335\" height=\"597\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f9cefb63f27444de680cb97b50ef61b369daf47e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"328\" height=\"597\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">長袍盔甲</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49e632e202236391dd2a6697223ec7b0bbb127b6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"462\" height=\"781\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bf2b73c9e8be1e1847677dbd6e79efb4e234de1d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"574\" height=\"849\"></span></p>\n</div>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有武器：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/52f3de43e866c98c3c4ea7903e2e8d0bdcdab4d4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1981\" height=\"1134\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/160d25c5bdb4ceb74d388506cce363729291505a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1977\" height=\"1139\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1676615f35977da4491e3741a6958322ac6eff4d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1848\" height=\"1064\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">模組進程說明：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在遺忘森林生態域中，有兩種浮空柱，一種是帶有普通燈籠的普通柱，另一種是帶有藍色燈籠的柱。藍色燈籠柱中含有一種名為惡意礦石的新方塊，開採後可獲得惡意碎片。這可用於製作武器或召喚第一個罪之頭目——懶惰之罪。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1605e58ba71e3d1f3ed879243e8f2786477b6494.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"593\" height=\"284\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">按順序擊敗所有罪之頭目的流程如下：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">懶惰 &gt; 暴食 &gt; 色慾 &gt; 貪婪 &gt; 嫉妒 &gt; 憤怒 &gt; 傲慢 &gt; 暴行</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如何召喚懶惰之罪（第一個頭目）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9f34febd5e32c3e3c90b6c9055a11df00ec30351.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"480\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">右鍵點擊惡意神壇並使用靈魂編織者寶珠來召喚懶惰之罪。之後的下一個頭目需要包含先前擊敗頭目精華的寶珠。<br><strong>（此為1.19.4版本內容）</strong> 擊敗德拉卡拉後，你可能獲得她的蛋。放置蛋並等待5分鐘，它會孵化出一隻幼年翠綠蠕龍。再過5分鐘，它會成長為成年體，此時你可以馴服它。注意，它長大後可能會攻擊你。馴服後，你可以用它來陸地旅行。</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb369ce079396766f342361afa29c0bb5841d8d3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1079\" height=\"74\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\">目前暫無計劃將此模組移植到其他版本，也沒有近期推出Fabric版本的計劃。<br>你可以隨意將此模組用於模組包，但請保留原作者資訊，謝謝 :)</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fasto566554\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1062422473234194482/1278047061736161290/image.png?ex=66d00a54&amp;is=66ceb8d4&amp;hm=aed3d8c541d5bf81f5fd009f4a9908b3423b48e0b2eccfb29bc9600b6fedabcf&amp;\"></span></span></a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
